# Host node_modules hold darwin-arm64 binaries for better-sqlite3, sharp and onnxruntime; copied
# into a linux image they are worse than absent, because install would consider them satisfied.
**/node_modules
**/dist
# Only the WRITTEN data dirs. Not `**/data` — `packages/engine/src/data/` is source, and
# dropping it fails the client build on an unresolved import rather than at copy time. One level
# under `packages/` is where every writer puts its sqlite: @sj/town owns it now, and a baked
# `dev-world.db` seeds the named volume on a fresh box with a developer's town.
packages/*/data
.git
.claude
docs
**/*.log
